  "changes": [
    "PASSIVE is a capped three-read counter. Only a real W-source defender dodge recorded during actual dash movement earns a read; empty input, walls, fumble and other sources do not. Round reset clears reads.",
    "Q is a short single-target sword strike with one extra hit when it consumes its own two-second E counter mark. Other casters and expired marks cannot qualify.",
    "W is a 2.4-unit grounded directional slide with a 0.3-second capped evasion window for basic and ability damage. It has no jump or damage. Event-time displacement is immutable when hooks run later.",
    "E blocks one physical/magic hit within 0.45 seconds through its own source, pushes the attacker one unit and opens one Q follow-up. Shields, other block sources, true damage and expired windows do not qualify.",
    "R grants move and attack speed for three seconds while preserving existing skill cooldowns.",
    "EX requires three reads plus its own recent enemy engagement; target eligibility is checked before approach/payment and rechecked on arrival. It spends reads at acceptance and delivers one delayed high-damage strike.",
    "Shared sourceGrants exposes the existing ability-evasion channel. A reusable communityActionFixture drives real compiled heroes and deterministic combat for subsequent batches.",
    "Single-slot preview honestly prepares the installed self-resource and earns engagement through real enemy combat. The ordinary whole-kit smoke rejects EX when no slide dodges earned reads; a separate actual W/E/Q/R/EX combo passes at ranks 1 and 4 without seeding reads."
  ],
