  "initialFailures": [
    "The authoring recipe incorrectly put castType in abilityOverrides; moved it to the template parameters supported by the authoring contract.",
    "applyBuff could not author the existing ability evasion scope; added it to the shared schema/type/forwarding/presence contract instead of dropping ability dodges.",
    "The source-grant exact-key guard caught the new field missing from its roundtrip fixture; included both channel flags and retained the full equality check.",
    "Tests used the wrong approach-registry/boundary/type paths, read stats before recomputation and compared mana across regeneration; fixed fixtures and checked at the rejection instant.",
    "Genuine post-slide whiff recovery initially prevented the combo; waited for recovery rather than bypassing it. The correct castApproach regression path was separately run."
  ],
